<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stockroom | Add product</title>
    <style>
        :root { --ink: #172121; --muted: #697473; --line: #dfe7e4; --paper: #f6f8f5; --card: #ffffff; --accent: #d96c45; --accent-dark: #b94d2b; --mint: #d8eee6; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); font-family: "DM Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
        .shell { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr); }
        .aside { padding: 42px clamp(28px, 6vw, 88px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; background: #183b3b; color: #f5fbf7; }
        .brand { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .aside-content { max-width: 420px; padding: 12vh 0; }
        .eyebrow { color: #93cdbb; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        h1 { margin: 18px 0 20px; max-width: 430px; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
        .aside p { max-width: 350px; color: #bdd3cc; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
        .aside-footer { color: #88aaa1; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .05em; }
        .main { padding: 42px clamp(28px, 7vw, 110px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
        .topbar-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
        .nav-link { color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
        .nav-link:hover { color: var(--accent-dark); }
        .form-wrap { width: min(100%, 620px); margin: auto; padding: 50px 0; }
        .form-heading { margin-bottom: 34px; }
        .form-heading h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
        .form-heading p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
        form { padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 42px); background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(24, 59, 59, .07); }
        .field-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
        label { display: block; color: #53615f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        input { width: 100%; margin-top: 9px; padding: 14px 0; color: var(--ink); background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #b9c9c4; outline: 0; font: inherit; transition: border-color .2s; }
        input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
        .full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
        button { width: 100%; margin-top: 34px; padding: 15px 20px; color: #fff; background: var(--accent); border: 0; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-weight: 800; transition: background .2s, transform .2s; }
        button:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        @media (max-width: 760px) { .shell { display: block; } .aside { min-height: 340px; padding: 28px; } .aside-content { padding: 50px 0 10px; } .aside h1 { font-size: 50px; } .main { padding: 28px; } .form-wrap { padding: 50px 0 20px; } }
        @media (max-width: 480px) { .field-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .full { grid-column: auto; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="shell">
        <aside class="aside">
            <div class="brand">Stockroom / 03</div>
            <div class="aside-content">
                <div class="eyebrow">Simple inventory, clearly seen</div>
                <h1>Keep every item in view.</h1>
                <p>Add products to your catalog with the details your team needs to find, price, and move stock.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aside-footer">A calm place for the daily count.</div>
        </aside>
        <main class="main">
            <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Primary navigation">
                <span class="topbar-label">Catalog workspace</span>
                <a class="nav-link" href="/product_list">View product list <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
            </nav>
            <div class="form-wrap">
                <div class="form-heading">
                    <h2>Add a product</h2>
                    <p>Enter the essentials now. You can review everything from the catalog view.</p>
                </div>
                <form action="/save_product" method="post">
                    <div class="field-grid">
                        <label class="full">Product name
                            <input type="text" name="product_name" placeholder="e.g. Canvas day bag" required>
                        </label>
                        <label>Price
                            <input type="number" name="product_price" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00" required>
                        </label>
                        <label>Quantity
                            <input type="number" name="product_qty" min="0" placeholder="0" required>
                        </label>
                        <label class="full">Product details
                            <input type="text" name="product_detail" placeholder="Material, color, or a short note">
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit">Add to catalog <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
